# 3. CMakeLists.txt 등록

C++ 파일을 작성했다고 바로 `ros2 run`으로 실행할 수 있는 것은 아닙니다.

ROS2가 실행 파일로 사용할 수 있도록 `CMakeLists.txt`에 등록하고 빌드해야 합니다.

다음 파일을 엽니다.

```bash
gedit ~/Desktop/unitree_ros2/src/my_go2_nav/CMakeLists.txt
```

전체 내용을 아래와 같이 작성합니다.

```cmake
cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
project(my_go2_nav)

set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 17)
set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)

find_package(ament_cmake REQUIRED)
find_package(rclcpp REQUIRED)
find_package(geometry_msgs REQUIRED)
find_package(nav_msgs REQUIRED)
find_package(tf2 REQUIRED)
find_package(tf2_ros REQUIRED)
find_package(unitree_api REQUIRED)
find_package(unitree_go REQUIRED)

# -------------------------------------------------
# /cmd_vel → Unitree Sport API 브리지
# -------------------------------------------------

add_executable(go2_nav_bridge
  src/go2_nav_bridge.cpp
  src/ros2_sport_client.cpp
  src/go2_sport_client.cpp
)

target_include_directories(go2_nav_bridge PUBLIC
  $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include>
  $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include/common>
  src
)

ament_target_dependencies(go2_nav_bridge
  rclcpp
  geometry_msgs
  nav_msgs
  tf2
  tf2_ros
  unitree_api
  unitree_go
)

# -------------------------------------------------
# 기존 Go2 기본 Sport API 예제
# -------------------------------------------------

add_executable(go2_basic_demo
  src/go2_basic_demo.cpp
  src/ros2_sport_client.cpp
)

target_include_directories(go2_basic_demo PUBLIC
  $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include>
  $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include/common>
  src
)

ament_target_dependencies(go2_basic_demo
  rclcpp
  unitree_api
  unitree_go
)

# -------------------------------------------------
# 학생 Sport API 실습 노드
# -------------------------------------------------

add_executable(student_sport_demo
  src/student_sport_demo.cpp
  src/ros2_sport_client.cpp
)

target_include_directories(student_sport_demo PUBLIC
  $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include>
  $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include/common>
  src
)

ament_target_dependencies(student_sport_demo
  rclcpp
  unitree_api
  unitree_go
)

# -------------------------------------------------
# 실행 파일 설치
# -------------------------------------------------

install(TARGETS
  go2_nav_bridge
  go2_basic_demo
  student_sport_demo
  DESTINATION lib/${PROJECT_NAME}
)

ament_package()
```

여기서 새로 작성한 파일을 ROS2 실행 파일로 만드는 부분은 다음입니다.

```cmake
add_executable(student_sport_demo
  src/student_sport_demo.cpp
  src/ros2_sport_client.cpp
)
```

그리고 필요한 ROS2 및 Unitree 패키지를 연결합니다.

```cmake
ament_target_dependencies(student_sport_demo
  rclcpp
  unitree_api
  unitree_go
)
```

마지막으로 `ros2 run`에서 찾을 수 있도록 실행 파일을 설치 대상으로 등록합니다.

```cmake
install(TARGETS
  go2_nav_bridge
  go2_basic_demo
  student_sport_demo
  DESTINATION lib/${PROJECT_NAME}
)
```

